      </table>
    </div>
    <div class="note">Penyusutan 2-itemset dari 115.921 menjadi 30 terjadi karena rata-rata transaksi hanya berisi 8,70 buku, jauh lebih kecil dibanding luas ruang katalog yang dianalisis (2.022 judul).</div>
  </div>
  <div class="pageno">13</div>
</section>

<!-- 14 ATURAN -->
<section class="slide" style="--tint:var(--clay)">
  <div class="spine"><span>BAB IV · Hasil</span></div>
  <h2>Aturan asosiasi dengan confidence tertinggi</h2>
  <div class="hr"></div>
  <div class="body">
    <div class="tablewrap">
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr><th>Jika meminjam</th><th>Maka meminjam</th><th class="n">Support</th><th class="n">Confidence</th><th class="n">Lift</th></tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>Harry Potter and the Sorcerer's Stone (1)</td><td>Harry Potter and the Chamber of Secrets (2)</td><td class="n">1,06%</td><td class="n">72,82%</td><td class="n">44,96</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Harry Potter and the Chamber of Secrets (2)</td><td>Harry Potter and the Prisoner of Azkaban (3)</td><td class="n">1,14%</td><td class="n">70,43%</td><td class="n">41,33</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Harry Potter and the Prisoner of Azkaban (3)</td><td>Harry Potter and the Chamber of Secrets (2)</td><td class="n">1,14%</td><td class="n">66,94%</td><td class="n">41,33</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Harry Potter and the Goblet of Fire (4)</td><td>Harry Potter and the Prisoner of Azkaban (3)</td><td class="n">1,04%</td><td class="n">62,71%</td><td class="n">36,80</td></tr>
          <tr><td>The Queen of the Damned</td><td>The Vampire Lestat</td><td class="n">0,65%</td><td class="n">57,50%</td><td class="n">34,00</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Hot Six: A Stephanie Plum Novel</td><td>High Five: A Stephanie Plum Novel</td><td class="n">0,55%</td><td class="n">57,35%</td><td class="n">56,56</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <div class="note">Seluruh 50 aturan memiliki keterkaitan positif yang kuat — lift minimum 14,65, rata-rata 32,21. Namun 86% aturan berada pada confidence 30–60%, dan seluruhnya hanya melibatkan <strong>23 judul unik</strong> yang didominasi buku berseri.</div>
  </div>
  <div class="pageno">14</div>
</section>

<!-- 15 SKENARIO -->
<section class="slide" style="--tint:var(--clay)">
